# ==============================================================================
# AS MARKETING - Footwear Warehouse Inventory & GST Billing System
# Root Environment Reference Guide
# ==============================================================================
#
# This project separates backend and frontend applications:
#
# 1. BACKEND API (server/.env):
#    - Copy server/.env.example to server/.env
#    - Contains: PORT, MONGO_URI, JWT_SECRET, ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD, SMTP
#    - These are private, server-only variables that are NEVER sent to the client.
#
# 2. FRONTEND APP (client/.env):
#    - Copy client/.env.example to client/.env
#    - Contains: VITE_API_URL
#    - Only public configuration prefixed with VITE_ belongs here.
#
# SECURITY RULES:
# - All .env files are excluded from Git via .gitignore.
# - Do not commit real passwords, JWT secrets, or DB connection strings to Git.
# ==============================================================================
